2.The unaudited financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2022 were reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors at their meetings held on August 12, 2022. The Statutory Auditors of the Company have conducted a 'Limited Review' of the unaudited financial results. &lt;BR&gt; 
3.The Company is engaged in construction activities. The margins in the quarterly results vary based on the nature, type and quantum of project work executed during the quarter.  Due to this reason, quarterly results may vary in different quarters and may not be indicative of annual results. &lt;BR&gt; 
4.The Company has one reportable segment as "Construction" activities under Ind AS 108 "Operating Segments". &lt;BR&gt; 
5.Other income for the quarter ended June 30, 2022 includes Rs.1464.18 lakhs received towards additional land compensation inclusive of interest from National Highway Authority (NHAI) against compulsory acquisitions of part of Yelhanka Bengaluru Land.  The amount has been received on August 8, 2022. &lt;BR&gt; 
6.Effective 18th July, 2022, Goods and Service Tax (GST) rates on Infrastructure projects were enhanced from 12% to 18%. This increase has impacted margins for few projects where contract value is inclusive of GST. Total impact is estimated to be Rs.1037.47 lakhs out of which Rs.691.11 lakhs is accounted in current quarter resulting in reduction in Profit before tax to that extent. &lt;BR&gt; 
7.The figures for the quarter ended March 31, 2022 are the balancing figures between audited figures in respect of the full financial year and published year to date figures up to nine months ended December 31, 2021. &lt;BR&gt; 
8.As approved by the Members of the Company at the 96th Annual General Meeting held on July 28, 2022, the Company on August 2, 2022 had paid dividend of  Rs.2.00 per equity share of the face value of  Rs.2.00 each aggregating to Rs.968.94 lakhs for financial year 2021-22. &lt;BR&gt; 
9.Figures for the previous periods/year have been regrouped/re-classified to conform to the classification of the current period. &lt;BR&gt; 
